flowchart TD
    UninstallStart([生命周期入口]) --> UninstallLock[获取全局 APM 锁]
    UninstallLock -->|失败| UninstallLockFail[打印锁错误] --> UninstallLockExitError([未获得锁；非零退出])
    UninstallLock -->|成功| UninstallJournal{存在未完成 journal?}
    UninstallJournal -->|检查失败| UninstallJournalFail[打印 journal 检查错误] --> UninstallExitError([释放锁并非零退出])
    UninstallJournal -->|否| UninstallCommand[进入当前命令]
    UninstallJournal -->|是| UninstallDecide{根据阶段与路径状态判断提交点}
    UninstallDecide -->|提交点前| UninstallRepairRollback[回滚上次事务]
    UninstallDecide -->|提交点后| UninstallRepairCommit[完成上次事务提交]
    UninstallRepairRollback --> UninstallRepairResult{修复成功?}
    UninstallRepairCommit --> UninstallRepairResult
    UninstallRepairResult -->|否| UninstallRepairFail[保留 journal 并打印修复失败] --> UninstallExitError
    UninstallRepairResult -->|是| UninstallDeleteRecovered[删除已恢复 journal]
    UninstallDeleteRecovered -->|失败| UninstallDeleteRecoveredFail[保留 journal 并打印删除失败] --> UninstallExitError
    UninstallDeleteRecovered -->|成功| UninstallRepairLog[打印回滚或提交及修复内容] --> UninstallCommand
    UninstallRepairRollback -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted([内核释放锁；已存在的 journal 保留；下次命令预检恢复])
    UninstallRepairCommit -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallDeleteRecovered -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallJournal -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted

    UninstallCommand --> UninstallNextAgent{按已注册 Agent ID 升序还有目标 Agent?}
    UninstallNextAgent -->|否| UninstallPrintSuccessSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> UninstallOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    UninstallNextAgent -->|是| UninstallFind[从当前 Agent 本地清单按 power 与可选 type 定位；仅同名跨类型歧义时要求显式 type]
    UninstallFind -->|读取失败或类型歧义| UninstallFail[记录当前 Agent failed；其余按确定顺序标记 unexecuted]
    UninstallFind -->|未安装| UninstallSkip[打印未安装、无需处理；记录当前 Agent completed] --> UninstallNextAgent
    UninstallFind -->|已安装| UninstallAdapter["Resolve(currentAgent, type) 解析 Adapter"]
    UninstallAdapter -->|失败| UninstallFail

    subgraph UninstallPreCommit["提交点前事务阶段（失败时回滚）"]
        UninstallAdapter -->|成功| UninstallCreateJournal[创建 uninstall journal]
        UninstallCreateJournal -->|失败| UninstallFail
        UninstallCreateJournal -->|成功| UninstallIntent[持久化 removing 意图]
        UninstallIntent -->|失败| UninstallRollback[提交点前恢复原状态]
        UninstallIntent -->|成功| UninstallQuarantine[[原子移动正式内容到隔离目录：提交点]]
        UninstallQuarantine -->|未越过提交点| UninstallRollback
        UninstallRollback --> UninstallRollbackOK{回滚成功?}
        UninstallRollbackOK -->|是| UninstallRolledBack[删除 journal；打印回滚内容]
        UninstallRollbackOK -->|否| UninstallKeepRollback[保留 journal；打印回滚失败]
    end

    subgraph UninstallPostCommit["提交点后事务阶段（失败时完成提交）"]
        UninstallQuarantine -->|已越过提交点| UninstallUnregister[补全 Adapter 注销]
        UninstallUnregister -->|失败| UninstallFinishCommit[完成注销、清单删除与清理]
        UninstallUnregister -->|成功| UninstallManifest[原子删除安装清单记录]
        UninstallManifest -->|失败| UninstallFinishCommit
        UninstallManifest -->|成功| UninstallCleanup[清理隔离内容与 journal]
        UninstallCleanup -->|失败| UninstallFinishCommit
        UninstallCleanup -->|成功| UninstallRemoved[打印卸载成功；记录当前 Agent completed]
        UninstallFinishCommit --> UninstallCommitOK{提交补全成功?}
        UninstallCommitOK -->|是| UninstallCommitted[删除 journal；打印完成提交内容]
        UninstallCommitOK -->|否| UninstallKeepCommit[保留 journal；打印提交补全失败]
    end

    UninstallRemoved --> UninstallNextAgent
    UninstallRolledBack --> UninstallFail
    UninstallKeepRollback --> UninstallFail
    UninstallCommitted --> UninstallFail
    UninstallKeepCommit --> UninstallFail
    UninstallFail --> UninstallPrintFailureSummary[打印 completed、failed、unexecuted 汇总] --> UninstallBatchError([停止剩余 Agent；释放锁；非零退出])

    UninstallFind -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallAdapter -.进程中断.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallCreateJournal -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallIntent -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallQuarantine -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallUnregister -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallManifest -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallCleanup -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallRollback -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallRolledBack -.清理 journal 时中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallFinishCommit -.进程中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted
    UninstallCommitted -.清理 journal 时中断；保留 journal.-> UninstallInterrupted

    style UninstallPreCommit fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    style UninstallPostCommit fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
